msgid "AOND_1"
msgstr "Your AOND has been 1 hour"

msgid "AOND_2"
msgstr "Your AOND has been 2 hours"

msgid "AOND_3"
msgstr "Your AOND has been 3 hours. Please logout to have a rest and do some sports for your health."

msgid "AOND_MORE_3"
msgstr "You have already started the 4th hour, your game gain will be decreased to 50%. It's best for your health to logout and do some sports. Please arrange your study and living suitable."

msgid "AOND_MORE_5"
msgstr "You have been started unhealthy game time, please logout and have a rest. If you don't leave the game, it's bad for your health and your game gain will be decreased to 0. Until your AOFD is enough 5 hours, everything will be recovered."

msgid "NOTIFICATION/CLOSE"
msgstr "Ok"

msgid "NOTIFICATION/TITLE"
msgstr "Anti-online game addiction system warning"
